{"parse":{"title":"2026年3月12日维护内容","pageid":8156,"revid":20390,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%8812%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%8812%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%8812%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E8%B5%84%E8%AE%AF\" title=\"铃兰资讯\">铃兰资讯</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4\" title=\"维护\">维护</a> &gt; <b>2026年3月12日维护内容</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E3.80.8A.E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91.E3.80.8B3.E6.9C.8812.E6.97.A5.E7.BB.B4.E6.8A.A4.E5.86.85.E5.AE.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"《铃兰之剑》3月12日维护内容\">《铃兰之剑》3月12日维护内容</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%8812%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：《铃兰之剑》3月12日维护内容\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：TapTap<br /><b>原作者</b>：努力上班的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2026-03-11<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.taptap.cn%2Fmoment%2F780858794820240235\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.taptap.cn/moment/780858794820240235</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px; opacity:0.8; margin-top:20px; margin: 20px 0 -15px 0; font-weight: normal; margin-left:0px;\"><img alt=\"笔记.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/40px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/60px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/80px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />【更新内容】</div>\n<p><br />\n1.重逢之时：<b>全装甲麦莎&amp;法卡尔•卫国之箭</b>\n<br />▶︎&#160;活动时间：\n<br />2026/03/13&#160;12:00&#160;-&#160;2026/03/26&#160;23:59\n<br /><br />\n2.「镜中的我」贝拉外观复刻\n<br />▶︎&#160;活动时间：\n<br />2026/03/13&#160;00:00&#160;-&#160;2026/04/09&#160;23:59\n<br /><br />\n3.「妙想许愿机」限时活动\n<br />▶︎&#160;活动时间：\n<br />2026/03/13&#160;12:00&#160;-&#160;2026/03/26&#160;23:59\n<br /><br />\n4.「共揽星碑」限时活动\n<br />▶︎&#160;活动时间：\n<br />2026/03/13&#160;00:00&#160;-&#160;2026/03/26&#160;23:59\n<br /><br />\n5.「春意如诗」丰饶之角\n<br />▶︎&#160;活动时间：\n<br />2026/03/16&#160;00:00&#160;-&#160;2026/04/12&#160;11:59\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n<br />【战斗】修复了「冰原裂齿猪」的部分技能未正常显示「自然守护」词条的问题。\n<br />【愚者的旅程】修复了关卡10-2无法正常过关的问题。\n<br />【命运的螺旋】修正了部分技能文本中的错别字。\n<br />【流沙回廊】修正了部分描述文本中的错别字。\n<br />【凛风回廊】修复了个别情况下，任务「运筹帷幄」、「用兵如神」可能出现无法正常计数的问题。\n<br />【家园】修复了家园装扮中显示的角色羁绊等级和实际不一致的问题。\n<br />【冰与血之路】修复了部分单体攻击技能无法正确对「灾翼兽」造成伤害的问题。\n<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164227\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 89/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1917/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 234/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.146      1 -total\n 54.26%   15.273      1 模板:面包屑\n 45.40%   12.777      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:8156-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164227 and revision id 20390. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"维护","missing":true}],"images":["笔记.png","官方消息175.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"《铃兰之剑》3月12日维护内容","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"2026年3月12日维护内容","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"《铃兰之剑》3月12日维护内容"}],"displaytitle":"2026年3月12日维护内容","wikitext":"{{面包屑|铃兰资讯|维护}}\n=《铃兰之剑》3月12日维护内容=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=维护\n|时间=2026-03-11\n|作者=努力上班的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=TapTap\n|原文地址=https://www.taptap.cn/moment/780858794820240235\n}}\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px; opacity:0.8; margin-top:20px; margin: 20px 0 -15px 0; font-weight: normal; margin-left:0px;\">[[file:笔记.png|40px|link=]]【更新内容】</div>\n<br>\n1.重逢之时：'''全装甲麦莎&法卡尔•卫国之箭'''\n<br>▶︎&nbsp;活动时间：\n<br>2026/03/13&nbsp;12:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;2026/03/26&nbsp;23:59\n<br><br>\n2.「镜中的我」贝拉外观复刻\n<br>▶︎&nbsp;活动时间：\n<br>2026/03/13&nbsp;00:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;2026/04/09&nbsp;23:59\n<br><br>\n3.「妙想许愿机」限时活动\n<br>▶︎&nbsp;活动时间：\n<br>2026/03/13&nbsp;12:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;2026/03/26&nbsp;23:59\n<br><br>\n4.「共揽星碑」限时活动\n<br>▶︎&nbsp;活动时间：\n<br>2026/03/13&nbsp;00:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;2026/03/26&nbsp;23:59\n<br><br>\n5.「春意如诗」丰饶之角\n<br>▶︎&nbsp;活动时间：\n<br>2026/03/16&nbsp;00:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;2026/04/12&nbsp;11:59\n[[file:官方消息175.png|560px|link=]]\n<br>【战斗】修复了「冰原裂齿猪」的部分技能未正常显示「自然守护」词条的问题。\n<br>【愚者的旅程】修复了关卡10-2无法正常过关的问题。\n<br>【命运的螺旋】修正了部分技能文本中的错别字。\n<br>【流沙回廊】修正了部分描述文本中的错别字。\n<br>【凛风回廊】修复了个别情况下，任务「运筹帷幄」、「用兵如神」可能出现无法正常计数的问题。\n<br>【家园】修复了家园装扮中显示的角色羁绊等级和实际不一致的问题。\n<br>【冰与血之路】修复了部分单体攻击技能无法正确对「灾翼兽」造成伤害的问题。\n<br>\n[[file:官方消息175.png|560px|link=]]\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:42:28.124491+00:00"}